        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Fusion 15-B9, Rope Half Round Knob with Oval Rope Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe perfect matching set, Fusion Hardware's Rope Knob with the Oval Rope Rose is an excellent choice for anyone with more traditional tastes. Available in 3 finishes, this solid brass knobset will fit 1-1/4 inch to 2 inch thick doors and has an optional backset for either 2-3/8 inches or 2-3/4 inches.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Fusion 15-B9 Rope Half-Round Knob and Oval Rope Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Solid Brass/Bronze Construction</li>\r\n<li>Cycle Tested to ANSI Standards</li>\r\n<li>Exclusive Fusion knob spring assembly for lifetime performance</li>\r\n<li>Reversible Latchbolt in matching/coordinating finish</li>\r\n<li>Easy assembly with alignment block and rose posts</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> for the Traditional Door Knob Fusion 15 B9:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2-1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 3-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Projection: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: adjustable for 1-1/4\" to 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Backsets: Either 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass and Bronze</li>\r\n<li>Standard Latch Rotation is 40 Degrees.</li>\r\n<li>Square corner latches and strike plates </li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Limited Warranty on workmanship, materials, and operation.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on one side of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Set:</b> Non-functional pull to match trim on both sides of the door. Just for looks, it does not latch and does not lock.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (Hall or Closet):</b> For doors that don't need locking.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (Bedroom or Bathroom):</b> For doors that could need locking.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>",
